---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND, LOCALES } from '../../config/brand.mjs';
export async function getStaticPaths(){ return LOCALES.map((lang)=>({params:{lang}})); }
const { lang } = Astro.params;
---
<BaseLayout lang={lang} path="privacy" title="Privacy Policy"
  description="What data HANKUKIN collects, which third parties are involved, and how cookies are used.">
  <div class="wrap policy">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated 13 August 2026</p>

    <p>This policy explains what happens to data when you visit {BRAND.primaryDomain}. It covers
    cookies, analytics, advertising and affiliate tracking.</p>

    <h2>What we collect ourselves</h2>
    <p>We do not ask you to create an account and we do not collect names, addresses or payment
    details. If you email us or submit an error report, we receive whatever you choose to send and
    keep it only as long as needed to respond.</p>

    <h2>Cookies, web beacons and IP addresses</h2>
    <p>This site and the third parties listed below may use cookies, web beacons and similar
    technologies, and may receive your IP address, device and browser information, approximate
    location derived from your IP address, and the pages you view. This information is used to
    measure traffic, to attribute referrals to merchants, and to select and measure advertising.</p>

    <h2>Third parties that may set cookies</h2>
    <p><strong>Please note that third parties, including advertising partners, may set cookies on
    your device through this site.</strong> We do not control those cookies. The third parties we
    work with are:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Analytics providers</strong> — to count visits and understand which pages are useful.</li>
      <li><strong>Advertising networks, including Google</strong> — Google and its partners may use
      cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this and other websites. You can review how
      Google uses information from sites that use its services at
      <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>,
      and manage personalised advertising at
      <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">google.com/settings/ads</a>.
      You may opt out of personalised advertising from participating vendors at
      <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</li>
      <li><strong>Affiliate networks and merchants</strong> — when you follow a link to a merchant,
      that merchant may set a cookie to attribute your visit to us. Their own privacy policy governs
      what happens on their site.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Controlling cookies</h2>
    <p>Most browsers let you refuse or delete cookies through their settings. Blocking cookies will
    not prevent you from reading this site, though some measurement and attribution will not work.</p>

    <h2>Children</h2>
    <p>This site is not directed at children, and we do not knowingly collect personal information
    from them. We also do not collect or republish personal information about minors as editorial
    subject matter — see our <a href={`/${lang}/editorial-policy`}>editorial policy</a>.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data
    we hold about you, or to object to its processing. Contact us at {BRAND.supportEmail} and we will
    respond within a reasonable period.</p>

    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>This site links to merchants, official pages and news sources. We are not responsible for the
    privacy practices of those sites.</p>

    <h2>Changes</h2>
    <p>We will update this page when our processing changes, and will revise the date at the top.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{BRAND.supportEmail}</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
